    a: "The analyst owns the model and the documents and keeps the process organized. Before launch that means the valuation, buyer list, teaser and CIM. During the bid rounds it means tracking buyers, running the data room, answering questions and comparing bids. At the end it means supporting the negotiation, the fairness opinion and closing.",
